fault-page = Something went wrong
fault-unknown-client = This app is not registered here
fault-unknown-client-body = The app asked for access with a client or a return address this server does not know. Go back to the app and try again, or ask its supplier.
fault-lapsed = This request has ended
fault-lapsed-body = The sign-in took too long or was already finished. Go back to the app and start again.
fault-other-browser = This sign-in began elsewhere
fault-other-browser-body = The sign-in did not begin in this browser, so it cannot finish here. Go back to the app and start again.
fault-bad-request = This request cannot be read
fault-bad-request-body = The address or the form was incomplete. Go back to the app and start again.
fault-server = The server could not complete this
fault-server-body = Something failed on our side. Try again in a moment.
consent-remember = Remember this choice for { $client }
consent-remember-help = Next time { $client } asks for the same access, you are not asked again. You can withdraw it on the page that lists your choices.
manage-page = Your choices
manage-title = Apps you allowed
manage-intro = These apps keep access to your data: the access you chose to remember, and the access that lasts after you leave the app. Withdraw one and it must ask you again; its current access ends at once.
manage-none = No app keeps access to your data.
manage-offline = This app stays connected after you sign out, until you withdraw it.
manage-online = This app stays connected while you are signed in.
manage-organisation = Your organisation approved this app for its staff. Ask your administrator to withdraw it.
manage-withdraw = Withdraw
manage-scope = Access given
